@host = http://localhost:5080

# Contratos y respuestas: {{host}}/swagger
# Las lecturas y la evaluación diaria son operaciones de soporte (grupo Soporte en Swagger).

### Register a vehicle
POST {{host}}/api/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plate": "ABC123",
  "mileage": 20000
}

### Add a routine
POST {{host}}/api/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}/routines
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cambio de aceite",
  "kilometers": 10000,
  "months": 6,
  "date": "2026-01-01"
}

### Reading that makes the routine due soon
POST {{host}}/api/telemetry/readings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-due-soon",
  "plate": "ABC123",
  "mileage": 29000,
  "readingDate": "2026-06-01"
}

### Reading that expires the routine and creates the order
POST {{host}}/api/telemetry/readings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-overdue",
  "plate": "ABC123",
  "mileage": 30000,
  "readingDate": "2026-07-01"
}

### Daily evaluation with a simulated date
POST {{host}}/api/processes/daily-evaluation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-07-01"
}
